zing cleanliness, sanitation, and community engagement, Assam is contributing to a healthier and more sustainable future for its citizens. The state's commitment to the Swachh Bharat Abhiyan demonstrates its dedication to improving the quality of life for all its residents. The achievement at IITF 2025 solidifies Assam's position as a leader in sanitation and cleanliness initiatives in the region.\n\n**SEO Tags:** Assam, Swachh Bharat Abhiyan, IITF 2025, sanitation, cleanliness, North East India, Assam news, India International Trade Fair\n"
