lders are calling for the following:\n\n*   **Transparent Investigation:** A thorough and impartial investigation into the allegations of mismanagement and neglect is necessary to ascertain the facts and identify any wrongdoing.\n\n*   **Appointment of an Interim Head:** If the Vice-Chancellor is unable to fulfill their responsibilities, the appointment of an interim head is crucial to provide stability and leadership to the university.\n\n*   **Government Intervention:** The Ministry of Education should take a proactive role in addressing the issues at ACU and ensuring that the university is functioning effectively and in accordance with its mandate.\n\n*   **Stakeholder Engagement:** Open communication and engagement with faculty, students, and other stakeholders are essential to restore trust and confidence in the university's leadership.\n\n**Conclusion**\n\nThe controversy surrounding Assam Central University highlights the importance of effective leadership and government oversight in ensuring the quality of higher education institutions. Failure to address these issues promptly could have serious consequences for the university, its students, and the broader academic landscape of the Northeast. It remains to be seen whether the government will step in to resolve the situation and restore stability to this vital institution.\n\n**SEO Tags:** Assam Central University, ACU, Vice Chancellor, Modi Government, Central University, Northeast India, Higher Education, University Controversy\n"
