ontribute to a smooth and successful festival. We encourage everyone to plan accordingly and embrace the spirit of the Megong Festival.\n\n**SEO Tags:** Megong Festival, Tura, Meghalaya, Traffic Restrictions, Road Closures, Meghalaya Police, Garo Hills, North East India\n"
