 fairness, equity, and the protection of employee rights in government programs. While the financial implications for the Assam government are considerable, the decision also provides an opportunity to reassess and improve the design and implementation of future rehabilitation initiatives.\n\n**SEO Tags:** Assam government, Supreme Court ruling, terror rehabilitation scheme, ₹2 crore payout, government appointees, Assam news, North East India, rehabilitation programs\n"
