nt:** Identifying sources of funding, whether through public-private partnerships or other means, is crucial for project implementation.\n\nThe Assam government's proactive approach to airport expansion demonstrates a commitment to the region's future. While the third terminal remains in the planning stages, its potential benefits for connectivity, economic growth, and tourism are undeniable. North East Connect will continue to monitor developments and provide updates on this important infrastructure project.\n\n**SEO Tags:** Guwahati Airport, Assam, Airport Expansion, Northeast India, Air Travel, Airport Infrastructure, Guwahati News\n"
