ncreasingly complex world. By prioritizing values such as responsibility, empathy, and integrity, we can empower the next generation to become responsible citizens, ethical leaders, and compassionate members of the North East community. A well-designed moral education program can be the boost that school systems across the region require.\n\n**SEO Tags:** moral education, North East schools, ethics, values, character development, bullying prevention, citizenship, academic integrity\n"
