ommitment to border security.\n\n**Conclusion:**\n\nThe recent exercise in Arunachal Pradesh underscores the Indian Army's dedication to strengthening its operational capabilities in challenging terrains. By validating critical helicopter insertion strategies, the Army is better equipped to maintain security, provide logistical support, and respond effectively to any contingencies in the remote Vijaynagar salient and other strategically important areas along the northeastern border. The focus on rapid deployment, logistical support, and medical readiness demonstrates a comprehensive approach to ensuring the safety and security of the region.\n\n**SEO Tags:** Arunachal Pradesh, Indian Army, Assam Rifles, helicopter insertion, Vijaynagar salient, North East India, security exercise, border security\n"
