l roles in shaping voter sentiment. A unified BJP, as envisioned by Sonowal, would be better positioned to address these challenges and present a compelling vision for the future of Assam.\n\nThe emphasis on unity also reflects a broader understanding of the importance of perception in politics. A party that appears fractured or divided can struggle to gain the trust and confidence of voters. By projecting an image of solidarity and common purpose, the BJP aims to enhance its appeal and strengthen its electoral prospects.\n\nIn essence, Sonowal's caution serves as a reminder that collective effort and strategic alignment are essential ingredients for success in any electoral endeavor. As Assam moves closer to the 2026 elections, the BJP's ability to heed this call for unity will likely play a significant role in determining the outcome.\n\n**SEO Tags:** Assam elections, BJP unity, Sarbananda Sonowal, 2026 polls, Assam politics, North East India, BJP Assam, Indian politics\n"
