ving forward, stakeholders must prioritize inclusive development strategies that address the root causes of demographic disparities and promote a shared sense of belonging for all residents of the North East.\n\n**SEO Tags:** Assam, Himanta Sarma, Hindu couples, population control, Assam demographics, family planning, North East India, population policy\n"
