 meticulously to guarantee the integrity of the electoral process. The credibility of future elections in Assam hinges on maintaining a voter roll that is accurate, inclusive, and free from manipulation.\n\n**SEO Tags:** Assam voter rolls, BJP allegations, voter roll manipulation, Assam elections 2024, Congress Raijor Dal, electoral fraud, Assam politics\n"
