e. The public will continue to keenly observe the progress, hoping for a resolution that upholds justice and maintains the integrity of the legal system.\n\n**SEO Tags:** Zubeen Garg case, Assam, special prosecutor, Ziaul Kamar, Pallab Kataki, Guwahati, Assam Tribune, North East India\n"
