rcement against illegal activities, community-based conservation programs, and transparent land allocation processes.\n\n**SEO Tags:** Assam eviction drive, Assam forest encroachment, Mizoram border dispute, Assam land rights, North East land conflict, Assam forest conservation, Assam Mizoram border, Forest protection claim\n"
