 party will depend on its ability to effectively communicate its vision and mobilize support across the state.\n\n**SEO Tags:** Assam elections, Raijor Dal, 2026 manifesto, Assam politics, regional parties, economic development Assam, social justice Assam, environmental protection Assam.\n"
