hter future for its young people and contribute to the state's overall development. This significant achievement showcases Assam's commitment to enhancing educational opportunities and empowering its future generations. It sets a positive precedent for further advancements in the state's educational landscape.\n\n**SEO Tags:** Assam education, school dropout rates, North East India education, secondary education Assam, education statistics, Assam government initiatives, education development, student retention\n\n"
