tial of its inland waterways, and improve the quality of education for its citizens. The projects are aligned with the state's development priorities and will contribute to a brighter future for Assam. The North East Connect will continue to provide updates on the implementation and impact of these transformative projects.\n\n**SEO Tags:** Assam, World Bank, funding, disaster management, inland waterways, education, development, North East India\n"
