e the exact date is yet to be announced, it usually occurs within the first few days of the session. This presentation will offer a detailed overview of proposed revenues, expenditures, and key policy changes. This is when the financial priorities will become clear.\n\n3.  **Late-Session: Debates and Approvals.** Following the budget presentation, expect days of robust debate and discussion among the assembly members. This period will involve scrutiny of the proposed financial plan and potential amendments. Ultimately, the budget will need to be approved by the assembly, solidifying its implementation.\n\n**What to Expect During the Session**\n\nBeyond the key dates, anticipate the following:\n\n*   **Focus on Key Sectors:** The Interim Budget will likely prioritize essential sectors like agriculture, healthcare, education, and infrastructure. Keep an eye on announcements related to these areas.\n*   **Economic Outlook:** The session will offer insights into the state's economic performance and future projections. This information will be crucial for businesses and investors.\n*   **Policy Announcements:** While primarily focused on finances, the session might also include announcements of new policies or amendments to existing ones that have budgetary implications.\n\n**Staying Informed**\n\nNorth East Connect will provide comprehensive coverage of the Assam Assembly's Interim Budget Session. Stay tuned for updates, analysis, and expert commentary on the key developments. By following the session closely, you can gain a better understanding of the financial decisions shaping Assam's future.\n\n**Conclusion**\n\nThe upcoming Interim Budget Session is a significant event for Assam. By understanding the key dates and what to expect, residents can stay informed and engaged in the state's financial planning process. As the session unfolds, keep an eye on North East Connect for the latest updates and insights.\n\n**SEO Tags:** Assam Budget, Assam Assembly, Interim Budget