onomic growth throughout the Northeast region. By highlighting the interconnectedness of the region, the importance of infrastructure development, and the potential of natural resources and tourism, he presented a compelling vision for the future of the Northeast. Whether or not every rupee invested has a ripple effect remains to be seen, but it is clear that Assam's success is intertwined with the prosperity of its neighboring states.\n\n**SEO Tags:** Assam investment, Northeast India, Himanta Biswa Sarma, Davos, Northeast economic growth, Assam economy, connectivity infrastructure\n"
