peration will depend on the active participation of pharmacists, collaboration with healthcare authorities, and a commitment to prioritizing public health.\n\n**SEO Tags:** Assam Pharmacy Council, Pharmacy Council Assam, Assam Government, Pharmacy Regulation Assam, Healthcare Assam, Pharmaceutical Sector Assam, Assam News, Guwahati News\n"
